#: scenario5:scenario5_DA07594C_05BB_4C6E_90E6_10C58B6D020E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a88e4924f0fb80366a85bcb4308f211b12f70efb27c7d52dd62ba585553df489
#. default-sha256: 2530da02d12fb5298c3ca50c7889eec1c4bdf7eec9736b0f1fdb4a9b5c3ec2b6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DA07594C_05BB_4C6E_90E6_10C58B6D020E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It would seem you are not aware whose house you’re trying to break into."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫어디에 발을 들이려는 건지, ⟪k:3⟫모르는 모양이로군……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2571D8CD_C2FB_4FEC_9C6F_2070907546C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fabfc1b7b1bf16bca7d3fa54dd239e3f9816070df22e714602bc10c512ca9f78
#. default-sha256: 787a2f66f060962c95816a9e7be99a831ced67b4807f59119fa50102b777eb08
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2571D8CD_C2FB_4FEC_9C6F_2070907546C7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The world went silent, like "
"time had come to a stop.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫No one could manage to say a word,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫――시간이 멈춘 것처럼 ⟪k:13⟫고"
"요해졌다.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫그 누구도 ⟪k:16⟫입을 열지 못 한 채로……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5B8B418A_299A_4647_BACA_BA4B0FA7E40C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4db9f535528b651cb535100802428fe593ab1d13a9d7b59f84b48e0ebcb0ce38
#. default-sha256: 9a8ec86887426a3d1963c9146af14947063b6d6695e5481c273579e594ebddcd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5B8B418A_299A_4647_BACA_BA4B0FA7E40C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫only stare at the man who had appeared from within the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저택 안에서 나타난 ⟪k:1⟫그 남자를 보았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_40BE19F6_C685_4BBB_AF0E_7D7350FEEDE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc95676477639a90f6b86b4b7c9387921d6a70cd8b206db5b1a806627f0f68f9
#. default-sha256: 8f6e8b7dda77ca03fd58664f401b6aa6563b46539a0cb44f975f81f1d69cb72b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_40BE19F6_C685_4BBB_AF0E_7D7350FEEDE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Surely you know what this place is called."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 저택이 무어라 불리는지 ⟪k:1⟫모르지는 않을 텐데……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F9198B71_C35F_4BD1_84C0_071E80B99ABA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4919574adc577827f2233f88909a02e7e458a04683f3bc61babb24aa8ad15485
#. default-sha256: 91e193d78a4c93d14fee45f414a041a239a73abcfe731e80abe1531b14a78457
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F9198B71_C35F_4BD1_84C0_071E80B99ABA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Beneath the dazzling midday sun,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫눈부신 햇살 밑에 드러난 그 사람은――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_231177F8_A960_411F_BAD4_D4A6BF6A7379
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12fd7b40b19e21fb8c68120cfcaae98c18a7564bf3277e9ed6357d897ad312c7
#. default-sha256: 4fdfcf0b67f66a367804b696961c6856dda053d814b512e7435ac00e52b57671
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_231177F8_A960_411F_BAD4_D4A6BF6A7379"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫he had bone-chillingly alabaster skin and long, nearly translucently pale hair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소름이 끼칠 만큼 흰 피부와 ⟪k:1⟫놀라우리만치 흰 순백색 장발을 지니고 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2D3C3470_7C9F_4431_B67D_D05BDB14A582
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 574c8e26dd1680036cfcb16f52899f76d4b3a153e5502cd5799a2bd83447c6f0
#. default-sha256: 26bfe5430941f02402c2c6c2791b5e2e9d3d436c1adedf4d75e63fbd4a4b4057
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2D3C3470_7C9F_4431_B67D_D05BDB14A582"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So surely you came prepared for whatever you would find..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫혹여 알고서 온 거라면 ⟪k:1⟫그만한 각오는 되어 있겠지……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D92D32C1_0A19_4E83_8C64_C449FF8172C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34d8b7d77e3c0643df0f3ce71ab3ee6a685238fef55e75d4c27937b877176cfe
#. default-sha256: a058c0423bd1e122d3d50c9d1bcf48f7a1e36646ed8d746d4a679809b87f3dfb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D92D32C1_0A19_4E83_8C64_C449FF8172C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And his eyes..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫부릅뜬 그 사람의 눈은――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D8D799E7_FF18_48BA_B6E3_2BE52A033C20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a70479ba0656342e40834d6fa310a594057ea4ba947c9a4aa802941b0ffc4829
#. default-sha256: fa7e7345fab4721cf42b31166d242b444fed4e9ebf15204622bd873cb84edada
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D8D799E7_FF18_48BA_B6E3_2BE52A033C20"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫were like two blazing infernos staring out across the mob."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫타오르는 화염처럼 일렁이는 ⟪k:5⟫붉은 눈이었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C3378308_A7A1_4887_A697_04438710BFDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0fdf1abc41246a4f9f3986cc335ba0d08291633f7b2a87a6205ce86baebe725
#. default-sha256: b5ebb101687cebd5e91059eb647da7d5000fdb95de3087269293db772e69bbc9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C3378308_A7A1_4887_A697_04438710BFDE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...A-⟪k:2⟫A demon..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………아, ⟪k:2⟫악마야………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BFA40E06_D27F_497F_B8CF_AE295E4DD6A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e893114c681cffd6eba5fdce813bef168298d4e5dacf6bbe141f4f0f491bf8d9
#. default-sha256: 3862c0e82632c5c8a96621f43289b9426bb98b29384776b6eb357cd4cb887dfc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BFA40E06_D27F_497F_B8CF_AE295E4DD6A5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Someone muttered, probably unconsciously."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫누군가가 ⟪k:1⟫넋을 놓고 ⟪k:2⟫그 말을 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_82BBF69C_0AA9_4DFA_BC35_4C07A8FFD1EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab703045499b8287e25fba42548d21ac3a9da86055b57a1506277ca6ad535f0a
#. default-sha256: 0ae5586d1b5dcc7deff51a26483d48b7a50f9a59d9ff96b9f7482aa0ed10dd0c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_82BBF69C_0AA9_4DFA_BC35_4C07A8FFD1EB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He did, indeed, look like something not of this world."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 말대로 그 사람의 용모는――, ⟪k:1⟫인간이 아닌 존재처럼 ⟪k:2⟫보였다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4E2AFB9D_7BB0_47E8_9C5E_82973E743E92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9798ed63bfe510e3404d606f30da71eda38acc10a577bc56e34362f885eeb02d
#. default-sha256: e0b827d899c7765f97028710098fce339c14ec519752a6513ead318e8171c83e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4E2AFB9D_7BB0_47E8_9C5E_82973E743E92"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Aaah, ⟪k:1⟫i-⟪k:2⟫it’s a demon!⟪k:3⟫The rumors about this place were true!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아아, ⟪k:1⟫아, ⟪k:2⟫악마야! ⟪k:3⟫저주받은 저택 소문은 ⟪k:4⟫진짜였구나……!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4D6A6178_F6D8_4178_A294_DC884CA04616
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1a72f7ff91672d51ec6987d825c06b4f7b966a62b12d5be59120e62e30ef4f0
#. default-sha256: 4c3481f4a67895a8b1401ab107cbc7eca5a93a50944aeba13e974d400ebd5a00
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4D6A6178_F6D8_4178_A294_DC884CA04616"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A cursed demon lives there!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저주받은 악마야……!!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B3899674_34FA_4458_A891_DA3A390A1B3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1e599ae93da389a4032773ef0c178557684065151e1549ada06bc8c5812c246
#. default-sha256: 9903c75e91b9dcdeb3c4f27b8a074c7a7b37101195a97dcf0f649e3429495c6f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B3899674_34FA_4458_A891_DA3A390A1B3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Demon? ⟪k:1⟫Him? ⟪k:2⟫Michel?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫악마……? ⟪k:1⟫저 사람――, ⟪k:2⟫……미셸이?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_29464700_1C60_48FD_9C75_F3152E457AF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db1d8dbf3df79fe77ee7387088bc05a87d49b2094ea411288e1dd9d3deb6f5be
#. default-sha256: f6f2ba33af9e828f83dbd38031c9cb57fa4e743d8939444c74fda6c4b62ee189
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_29464700_1C60_48FD_9C75_F3152E457AF3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No, he’s not curs—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아……, ⟪k:1⟫아니야, ⟪k:2⟫저 사람은 ⟪k:3⟫저주받지――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_AE7C1CB4_95F7_4057_8995_BE29E66375D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8590842dbaaecbe8cd8bf98a12ffe459c3cbe45790e2b969aeacc69d97d92870
#. default-sha256: 4e403f86669bec0b170ab1bab95ec590955f7c3d8f3760d2fb469135f0c1df9d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_AE7C1CB4_95F7_4057_8995_BE29E66375D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Indeed! I am cursed!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그래, ⟪k:3⟫맞다! ⟪k:4⟫나는 저주받았다!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_384DD30F_A1C3_4A73_BFCF_B7E3DFACBC6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40ed0825fc2861d38091f741265334f3657e2c4b4bf331bc2b440dab33a84045
#. default-sha256: e195870fe4ab9ee17f77cd67085c50e21799535d0eb8bc78bc752c6964223186
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_384DD30F_A1C3_4A73_BFCF_B7E3DFACBC6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫The witch’s curse is real!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I have "
"inherited it, in its entirety—⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫as well as her purpose!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫마녀의 저주는 실존한다! ⟪k:9⟫마녀의 뜻을, ⟪k:10⟫모든 "
"저주를 ⟪k:11⟫바로 내가 계승했다!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E59C58D1_E3D3_41A7_B771_B1C16E79855D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4242cf22feb59c1e639e9c49d2ccdff0c8db56c984c18159c1b957d476617d8
#. default-sha256: 4d342bf5eec96f6153e1ab8a14fb806d7d96c3285d06ed899a19f79147758572
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E59C58D1_E3D3_41A7_B771_B1C16E79855D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0CB33A79_4C6F_4949_B116_CA3F9D4681BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 517c8ed9f68c36061e3fb7920535e5fd52a3495c5be5f78f4e3ea93676e3a0bc
#. default-sha256: 5452e7c3c3d69e79554457fe11a5db04a9ee9803f4302a4ced7b91715c6d30f9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0CB33A79_4C6F_4949_B116_CA3F9D4681BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A witch, a demon, a spirit impure!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Call me whatever you wish!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마녀든 ⟪k:1⟫악마든 ⟪k:2⟫부정한 자든 ⟪k:3⟫마음대로 불러라!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D949
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b6302fc7a04fb98410a608f2521caa0b8a3a101522f7d46c8bd0b181cc7fea4
#. default-sha256: eb37caaff1c5f4c2c2fe715d9cac318710db649c76bdf808464927dabaf33acd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D949"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For the truth shall not change!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I carry within me an eternal curse!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 몸이 끝없는 저주를 깃들인 것만이 ⟪k:1⟫유일한 사실!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB95D949
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0328044d4811eb5a1ebab6163418e94e63b15a2f66c9cb2cd7f5af85b20736ac
#. default-sha256: db51141b083f3759cb7c2dcf49472cebb42d9b9a27415e64e2ddb1dd5f1c5f0a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB95D949"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Behold my flesh, pale as the moon!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No red blood flows beneath this skin, as it does "
"yours!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫보라, ⟪k:1⟫이 피가 돌지 않는 창백한 피부를!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내 피부 안에는 ⟪k:4⟫너희와 똑같은 붉은 "
"피가 흐르지 않는다!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D959
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c7d2804a1708a1727026f7c4216997b69202ab7e8c679fb470fde5c1d261d9f
#. default-sha256: 964c3fb4d762c304a2971c53b7d2eab586c7d03c5fc38ca95349b91f12ffd468
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D959"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Behold my hair, utterly devoid of color,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫offered up to the Devil as part of our "
"pact!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫보라, ⟪k:1⟫이 색채가 사라진 백발을!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나는 모든 색을 바침으로써 ⟪k:4⟫악마와 계약을 맺"
"었다!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D999
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eae90e4ee95e33a491d52d6412596e4aa4c833fc9f298280a854ee7458de0767
#. default-sha256: 5781d353e284cafa03684e09e6c8f7132ca0f8b5d21a56bc7aaf67c6368f3db7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D999"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Behold these crimson eyes!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A symbol of the lifeblood spilt at my hands!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫보라, ⟪k:1⟫이 붉은 눈을!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이게 바로…… 내가 앗은 수많은 생명이 흘리던 그 색의 증거!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D849
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbb3a64a3ea264d52015d475624f5e58467884d48f52d1e8a610e2dca5b46da5
#. default-sha256: e175b1eeadc709e8e3417e23a7177d0acf951e3e1303314a8c02a2474768005b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_711B9A6F_4494_4E8B_ACFC_EC7EEB85D849"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ah... ⟪k:1⟫aaah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아……, ⟪k:1⟫아아………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E22FD1CE_DC1F_4F16_898F_96EFD80B6207
